				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Another week in the <strong>Billboard 200</strong> (chart dated Feb. 20) for <strong>The Immaculate Collection</strong>: <strong>Madonna</strong>‘s first greatest hits (<strong>best-selling compilation album by a solo artist </strong>and<strong> one of the best selling albums of all time</strong>) goes down at <strong>#191</strong> (last week it was at #124).</p>
<p><strong>TIC</strong> sold <strong>2,678</strong> pure album sales, 6,035 digital tracks, 944,129 streams.</p>
